    "title": "Sheriff: Google Trawling Files to Find Video From Guthrie's Cameras | NTD",
    "text": "Sheriff Chris Nanos says his office is working with Google to obtain more camera footage relevant to the Nancy Guthrie abduction case.\nSpeaking to NewsNation on Tuesday, he said investigators have obtained Google Nest video from the entrance of Nancy Guthrie’s home, and that authorities have asked Google whether additional footage can be accessed.",
